From: "mumeyong.dev" <64839630+mumeyong@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:03:28 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] CLI: scrub Quickshell crash-relaunch env before
 spawning qs

After a crash, Quickshell relaunches the shell in place with
__QUICKSHELL_CRASH_INFO_FD set and never clears it, so commands the shell
runs (e.g. the onResume 'ambxst brightness -r') inherit it. The child
'qs ipc ... brightness pull' then takes the crash-relaunch path and boots a
second shell, doubling the bar's exclusive zone and pushing windows down.
---
 backend/cmd/ambxst/main.go       |  1 +
 backend/cmd/ambxst/qsenv.go      | 27 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 backend/cmd/ambxst/qsenv_test.go | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 51 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 backend/cmd/ambxst/qsenv.go
 create mode 100644 backend/cmd/ambxst/qsenv_test.go

diff --git a/backend/cmd/ambxst/main.go b/backend/cmd/ambxst/main.go
index 3ac3990..f96d956 100644
--- a/backend/cmd/ambxst/main.go
+++ b/backend/cmd/ambxst/main.go
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ import (
 var version = "dev"
 
 func main() {
